<i>Where's your mother? Maria?</i>
<i>ແມ່ຂອງເຈົ້າຢູ່ໃສ? ມາເຣຍ?</i>

996
01:14:17,340 --> 01:14:19,217
<i>Go on. Go, go, go, go.</i>
